'''Empyrean''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Mutations|mutation]] of [[Kitsune]].

The Empyrean version grants the user a slightly modified moveset, notable differences being the M1’s, {{Ability|Z}}, and transformed {{Ability|C}} abilities. When the [[Power Meter]] hits 3 tails, the first three M1’s will gain more range, similar to [[Dragon]] M1’s, and the fourth loses some damage in exchange for a large [[Area of Effect|AoE]] grab that pulls in nearby opponents. It is slightly better than the normal one.

While untransformed, {{Ability|Z}} shoots a beam at the cursor, which can be held to deal extreme damage. When transformed, the Empyrean version of {{Ability|Z}} has a modified animation compared to Kitsune's {{Ability|Kitsune|Z}}. Additionally, the held version of {{Ability|C}} is granted a special cutscene unique to the mutation.

==Obtainment==
As a [[Mutations|Mutation]], Empyrean has different obtainment methods compared to ordinary [[Blox Fruits]]. Players are able to obtain it in a few ways:
* Rolling it in through the limited-time [[Winter 2025 Fruit Box]]. ({{Skin|Galaxy}} Skin)
** [[Winter 2025 Fruit Box|The Winter 2025 Fruit Box]] can also be rolled as a '''Premium Box''' in the [[Winter Gacha]].
*Purchasing it in the mutation section of the Kitsune fruit for {{Robux|2,000}} (Must own [[Permanent Blox Fruits|Permanent]] [[Kitsune]] first).
*Purchasing the [[shop|Fox Spirit Bundle]] during the 2025 [[Christmas Event]].
* [[Trading]] for it, with it being a special item.

