==Trivia==
* The word “Empyrean” is derived from Greek origins (''en'' – ''pyr'') and translates to “in fire.”
* With 3 tails, the M1’s of the fruit at max tails lets off slash like projectile into a spin with grabbing hands.
* It is easier to damage laggy players with {{Ability|Z}} as their hitbox has delay and doesn't easily move.
* [[Kitsune]]'s first three M1 attacks actively grab and [[stun]] enemies, so even while the user is moving, the target/s will move along, though this is not the case for Empyrean as once it reaches 3 tails or transformed. Instead, the Empyrean's first three M1 attacks function like [[Dragon]]'s M1, pushing enemies forward.
* The transformed {{Ability|C}} (held version) cannot regenerate the Tails meter, despite being the most damaging transformed move.
* On the 6th day of the 2025 [[Christmas Event]], Empyrean was silently updated and its transformed {{Ability|C}} move now has the option for the normal ranged move by tapping it (identical to the normal [[Kitsune]] but with red flames), although transformed {{Ability|Z}} was nerfed and now it temporarily disables the user from using any move while using {{Ability|Z}}.
* When the player reaches 3 tails, the Empyrean version's M1's do significantly less damage, and do not actively grab like the ones seen on 1 and 2 tails and the regular [[Kitsune]]. Though it is compensated by the fact that their range is significantly increased. 
* Empyrean is the first [[Mutations|Mutation]] to have a [[Skins#Empyrean (Kitsune)|Skin]], with the second one being [[Fiend]]
* Despite being a '[[Mutations|Mutation]]', in gameplay Empyrean essentially outperforms [[Kitsune]] in nearly all aspects.
** Other mutations have alternate changes (for example; Werewolf being tankier and slower). Empyrean has no known changes apart from being stronger than it's counterpart, which has players criticizing Empyrean.
* Empyrean Kitsune has 9 tails while the regular one only has 5.
* Empyrean could not be found under trees like Werewolf and Fiend.
* Empyrean was often criticized for being completely locked behind a paywall unlike Werewolf, Fiend and Hellfire.

==Bugs==
* Empyrean (transformed) has a larger hitbox than normal [[Kitsune]] in some servers.
* While using Empyrean (transformed) during [[Ship Raid|Ship Raids]] or [[Haunted Ship Raid|Haunted Ship Raids]], when you try to approach the large ships, they teleport backwards at the same speed as you approach them.

